  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The number of electrons involved in the reaction are three as shown below\r\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}+3 e^{-} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Al}\r\n$$\r\nIt means the conversion of every aluminium ion to aluminium atom requires three electrons. Therefore, the amount of electricity required for one mole of $\\mathrm{Al}^{3+}$ ions $=3 \\mathrm{F}$.",
